    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d747">

                <pb facs="0770" n="666" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg666"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 882.51/495.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-12-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 23, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s December 19. Am cooperating heartily with German Consul to adjust
                    existing difficulties but believe efforts more fruitful if German commanders
                    assume more friendly attitude toward Liberian Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bundy</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
